<main class="page">
  <h1 data-testid="files-latest-heading">Latest file</h1>
  <p class="lead">A static sibling — <code>pages/routing/files/latest/page.abide</code>. It shares a prefix with the rest route <code>files/[...path]</code>, but an exact (all-literal) route always wins the match, so <code>/pages/routing/files/latest</code> reaches this dedicated page, not the catch-all.</p>

  <div class="row">
    <button data-testid="back-hub" onclick={() => navigate("/pages/routing")}>← back to hub</button>
  </div>
</main>
